      "text": "Purpose The short quizzes provide an opportunity to improve mathematical reading and problem-solving skills. These quizzes require NO prior knowledge of the material. Students only need to skim the OpenStax textbook, study graphs/illustrations, and look for key vocabulary and notation. Instructions Complete this quiz after reading through the corresponding section of the OpenStax textbook. Reading: https://openstax.org/books/calculus-volume-2/pages/1-5-substitutionLinks to an external site."
